Isa looks down at her slate.

"Neither did anybody else."

For a moment, she says nothing.

"You read the same logs I did."

+ ["He lived the life of a saint."] -> rule_shipTrophyIsaGanEdenSaint
+ [Return to index.] -> rule_index

